I worked through all 50 items from the prompt text alone. Two readings affected the answers:

- **"Top N points"** (H076, H097) means reaching at least N points. Under this reading, H076 is IMPLIES.
- **"Pot-one" and "seed"** are treated as the same thing: being the seeded team in the group.

For group items I counted how many outcomes can hold across all consistent league states. Where the count varies only between 0 and some maximum, the kind is `none`. Where a minimum of 1 always holds, the kind is `at_least_k`. Where the outcomes are mutually exclusive, the kind is `at_most_one`. Where exactly one holds in every state, the kind is `exactly_one`. Where the outcomes form a full implication chain, the kind is `ordered_chain`.

